
Research UNIX, Tenth Edition.

Restored by ipnx from the 1995 CSRC source tape.  The kernel is
ipnx780 -- configured for this machine and built here by V10 itself.
The commands are what V10 compiled from that tape, with Bell Labs own
binaries kept wherever we cannot build the program.

The filesystems on this disk were made, and filled, by the Tenth
Edition running on an emulated VAX.  It had never been booted.

